# OpenTofu
infra/**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
# Saved plans (tofu plan -out=...) hold every variable value in plaintext,
# secrets included, and this repository is public. Not anchored to infra/,
# so a new OpenTofu directory anywhere is covered too.
tfplan
tfplan.*
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.*
